window.products.push({"id":121045,"name":"Upgrade 8212560 & 8269145 Dishwasher Side Mount Bracket Kit by Beaquicy - Fit for Ken-more, Whirl-pool, Kitchen-Aid Dishwasher - 8212560 replaces 1201","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e9sL4dEoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝑷𝑨𝑪𝑲𝑨𝑮𝑬 𝑰𝑵𝑪𝑳𝑼𝑫𝑬𝑺】 - Includes 2 x 8212560 Dishwasher Mounting Brackets with 4 x Black Installation Screws, 2 x 8269145 Dishwasher Upper Brackets with 2 x Silver Installation Screws. Black and silver, different colors, and slightly different style/design. Durable 8212560 & 8269145 Dishwasher Side Mounting Bracket Kit with Screws is quick and easy to install, all you need is a screwdriver.You can have a working dishwasher in just a few minutes, and it's a great option! 【𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬𝑻𝑰𝑴𝑬 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】 - The 8212560 & 8269145 Whirl-pool Dishwasher Side Mounting Bracket Kit support LIFETIME return and exchange. ➤It can fix the FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS: The old one is damaged. Dishwasher moves. Dishwasher falling off cabinet. Dishwasher will tilt forward. Door latch failure. Door won’t close. ➤8212560 Undercounter Mounting Bracket replace: 1201084, AP3953705, PS1487167, EAP1487167, etc. ➤8269145 replace: WP8269145VP, 830941, AP6012289, PS11745496, EAP11745496, etc. 【𝑺𝑼𝑰𝑻𝑨𝑩𝑳𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝑴𝑨𝑵𝒀 𝑩𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑫𝑺】 - The 8212560 & 8269145 Dishwasher Bracket Side Mount Kit can replace for Cros-ley, Ken-more, May-tag, Whirl-pool and other brands dishwasher. ➤Compatible: kdfe104hbl0, kdtm504epa2, kdtm404ess3, kdte254ess2, kdtm504epa2, gu2275xtvb0, gu2275xtvq1, du1010xtxq5, du1014xtxt5, du1015xtxb0, du1014xtxb1, wdf111pabb2, wdf310plaw3, wdf730payt6, gu3200xtxq4, kudc10fxss7, kude20ixss3, kude40fxbl4, kude40fxwh1, mdbh979sab0, mdbh979saq0, mdbh979saw0, etc. 【𝟖𝟐𝟏𝟐𝟓𝟔𝟎 & 𝟖𝟐𝟔𝟗𝟏𝟒𝟓 𝑫𝑰𝑺𝑯𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹 𝑴𝑶𝑼𝑵𝑻𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑩𝑹𝑨𝑪𝑲𝑬𝑻 𝑲𝑰𝑻】 - ➤8212560 Dishwasher Side Mounting Bracket Kit with 4pcs black installation screws, secures the top of the dishwasher to the side of the cabinet. ➤8269145 dishwasher upper brackets with 2pcs silver installation screws, secures the upper side of the dishwasher to the underside of the counter or cabinet to prevent the dishwasher from moving, shaking, or tilting forward. 【𝑭𝑰𝑻 𝑴𝑨𝑵𝒀 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳】 - The 8212560 & 8269145 Dishwasher Side Mounting Bracket Kit can also fit the following models: 66512833K311, 66513253K110, 66513922K010, 66513923K010, 66513929K010, 66513942K015, 66513943K014, 66513943K015, 66513944K014, 66513944K015, 66513949K014, 66513964K014, 66513969K014, 66514043K010, 66514043K014, 66512093K210, 66512413N410, 66512413N411, 66512413N412, 66512723K310, 66512723K311, 66513009N511, 66513009N510, 66513004N511, 66513004N510, 66513003N511, etc. 【𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵】 - The installation of 8212560 & 8269145 dishwasher mounting bracket with screws are simple. Before installation, please disconnect the power and water supply and put on working gloves. Determine the position of the mounting brackets, insert the mounting brackets into the rack, screw them through the round holes in the brackets and fix them in the cabinet. NOTE: Make sure that the dishwasher does not wobble. If it does, please continue to tighten the screws.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e9sL4dEoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08JLSS7SN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-121045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JLSS7SN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JLSS7SN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
