window.products.push({"id":121219,"name":"Waterspecialist XWF NSF Certified Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® XWF, 3 Filters (Package may vary)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5SHqO5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacement for models: GE XWF, GE WR17X30702, Waterdrop WD-F48, Maxblue MB-F48, AQUACREST AQF-FF48, FilterLogic FL-RF48, Crystala CF9, Glacier Fresh GF-XWF, Pureza PF9. Note: XWF! This filter is replacement for XWF, not XWFE! Great filtration: Waterspecialist refrigerator filters can reduce many harmful substances in water including heavy metals, mercury, chlorine, odor, THM, VOCs (volatile organic compounds), particles, copper, cadmium, chromium, and all other major impurities. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. Premium filter material: Waterspecialist refrigerator water filter not only features prior filtration performance but also certified by authority NSF 42 and 372 for lead-free materials. We also adopt 100% natural coconut shell carbon block that contains larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently reduce chlorine, bad taste and odor. Perfect fit: Waterspecialist combines precision measurement technology to produce 100% fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering designs, unlike inferior replacement filters that can cause water leakage issues. Also, Waterspecialist saves you time and hassle by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacements. Food-grade materials: We select exclusively BPA-free and food-grade filter materials. Waterspecialist is here to protect your water safety. Monthly install stickers: Expired replacement filters might cause an accumulation of pollutants and only achieve low-standard filtration performance. Therefore, Waterspecialist filters come with date labels that remind you to change it on time. Besides, the filter life is 6 months or 200 gallons (varies based on the water condition). Responsibility: Each product manufactured by Waterspecialist, must pass extremely high examination standards. This does not stop when a filter leaves our factory: our 24/7 customer service team will provide water purification solutions and help you answer your questions at any time. Compatible with: GBE21, GDE21, GDE25, GFE24, GFE26, GNE21, GNE25, GNE27, GYE18, QNE27, GSE25, GSS23, GSS25, GZS22, PSE25, CZS22, GNE27JSMSS, GNE27JMMES, GNE27ESMSS, GNE27JGMBB, GNE27JGMWW, GSE23, GSE23G, GSE26, CFE26, XFE26, CWE19. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5SHqO5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterspecialist","source_asin":"B07ZCFX1F6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-121219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZCFX1F6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZCFX1F6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
