window.products.push({"id":121395,"name":"Portable washing machine Nictemaw Compact Twin Tub Washer 21.5lbs, Mini Washer(13.5lbs)&Dryer(8lbs) Semi-Auto with Time Control Function for Home/Apar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h6jQ+005L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Powerful Cleaning: This compact twin tub portable washing machine has separate timer control settings for washer and spinner operations, washer timer for 15 min and the spin timer to 5 minutes per load. It can meet all your washing duty like T-shirt, sweat, coat, sheet, thick clothes etc., which will relief yourself from hand washing. And it is equipped with a drain hose which allows you to drain out dirty water directly after washing. Twin Tub Washing Design: This Mini portable washing machine is designed with Twin Tub, which can save your precious time by washing and spinning dry loads at the same time. You can move clothes directly from the washer to the spinner, or run both tubs together to finish your laundry. It has a cover plate when you use the spin tub, can easily put above the cloths and avoid the high speed throw away. Easy Operation: This washing machine’ operation panel is designed very simply, wash timing, wash options, drain options, and spin timing, more easier to use. Allows you to simply put in your load of clothes, fill with water, set the timer and start washing, clothes will be almost dry in 5 minutes after spinning, so you don’t worry wear the wet clothes in the rainy days. Completely suitable for everywhere like dorms, bathroom, apartment, RV's and so on. Large Capacity and Space Saving: Total capacity: 21.2lbs(washer:13.2lbs, spin tub:8lbs), for doing light to medium laundry loads. You can wash the clothes of the whole family at the same time! What’s more, it’s easy to move and transport to anywhere, lightweight and space-saving design allows it easily fit in a bathroom or closet, ideal for camping trips, dormitories, or anywhere with limited space. Worry free for after-sales services: This Product Built to North American Electrical Standards, and we provide two years warranty and 7X24H online customer service. Therefore please get it with mind free. Welcome to contact our customer service email if any problems, we're responsible for any problems in any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h6jQ+005L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B08NPFM3QT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-121395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NPFM3QT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NPFM3QT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
