window.products.push({"id":121590,"name":"Water Line Professor - Frozen Water Line Tool - Quickly and Easily Unfreeze Your Refrigerator Water Dispenser (24 in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VLwc27AHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Has your refrigerator water dispenser stopped working all of a sudden, but the ice maker still works? Chances are your water line is frozen inside the fridge freezer door. (This is VERY common with GE and several other major brand refrigerators) To be 100% sure that is the issue, insert a 8”- 12” zip tie or weed whacker line into the water dispenser tube. If it goes all the way in, you do not have a frozen line. If it does not insert fully, you DO have a frozen water line....and we can help!! Water Line Professor can thaw a frozen water line in just a few seconds! It allows you to squirt HOT water directly onto the ice blockage that is causing your water dispenser to not work. Are you scared to call a repair person or service technician because of the high cost? Water Line Professor is your own personal appliance repairman. Water Line Professor saves you the expense and the hassle - it's a great DIY tool to fix the common problem of frozen water dispensers. And it's so easy to use! It is a premium leak-free syringe with custom small diameter tubing that is made to fit inside your dispenser outlet line. And good news – our tubing is extra long to reach the ice blockage every time. Other products use 18” or less of tubing, while we offer 24” of tubing! Don’t settle for less……Water Line Professor is THE go-to frozen water line tool. Click the \"Add to Cart\" button above and you'll have a working water dispenser in no time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VLwc27AHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Water Line Professor","source_asin":"B07S9BWFH4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-121590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S9BWFH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S9BWFH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
