window.products.push({"id":121671,"name":"Homguava 20Lbs Capacity Portable Washing Machine Washer and Dryer Combo Twin Tub Laundry 2 In 1 Washer(12Lbs) & Spinner(8Lbs) with Built-in Gravity Dr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dgklw4spL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Twin Tub And 20LBS Capacity】:The washing machine has twin tub design for both cleaning and drying,saving your valuable time. With 12 lbs wash capacity and 8 lbs spin capacity,the washer is perfect for washing daily laundry quickly.Moreover, transparent cover allows you to check the washing/spinning process at any time. Constructed of High-density plastic body+ Aluminum pump+ Upgraded motor, it is well built for years use. 【Portable and Widely Use】:With a total weight of around 30 pounds,the portable mini washer can be easily moved and transported.The size of 24\" x 14.5\" x 29\" inches is suitable for limited space.Lightweight and space-saving design for easy storage in apartments,dorms,RVs,bathroom or any other places.You can connect it easily to any faucet, whether it be at the kitchen sink or in the bathroom. 【Separate Time Control & Noise Reduction】:The washer and dryer has separate timer control, which make laundry washing more convenient and efficient.The washer control timer runs for up to 15 minutes while the spin cycle timer runs for up to 5 minutes for each load. Its noise is under 20 dB, which is quiet enough for you to run the machine even at night.All the washers passed the noise test, so that it will not disturb your life when use it. 【Easy to Operate】:When receiving the portable washing machines,it can be used directly without assembly.And you can choose three washing modes according to your needs. Simply put in clothes and detergent, fill with water, set the timer and start washing/spinning, the washer and spinner can run at the same time. Equipped with a built-in drainage pump, the machine can quickly discharge the water from the tub. The filter device in the tub can also collect debris with a powerful cleaning function. 【Save Water and Electricity】:The semi-automatic washing machine is compact and low power to save a lot of water and power. The dual motor system of washer presents strong laundry power, which shows in the washing power (260W) and spinning power (140W).The True rinse technology delivers the best rinsing results ever, without wasting water.It is highly efficient and compact. You can still enjoy the good quality washing and drying from our washing machine and dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dgklw4spL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homguava","source_asin":"B0BN5W1NMR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-121671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN5W1NMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN5W1NMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
