window.products.push({"id":121909,"name":"W10400895 Washer Suspension Tub Centering Spring (4 Pack) by Beaquicy - Fit for Ken-more Whirlpool Roper Crosley Washer mvwx600xl1 wtw4880aw1 rtw4740y","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719+EOdu17L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟒 𝑷𝑨𝑪𝑲 𝑾𝟏𝟎𝟒𝟎𝟎𝟖𝟗𝟓 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹 𝑺𝑼𝑺𝑷𝑬𝑵𝑺𝑰𝑶𝑵 𝑺𝑷𝑹𝑰𝑵】: The W10400895 Washer Suspension Tub Centering Spring is located around the drum of the washer and are distributed between the drum and the washing machine suspension rod. The springs reduce the amount of wobble fixed between the suspension ball and the drum, thus allowing the drum to be kept in balance. One spring should be used on each of the four sides of each washing machine to enable the springs to function better. The package includes 4 x W10400895 Suspension Spring. The springs have been upgraded in materials that are less prone to deformation and reverts well to its previous appearance after elongation. 【𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑰𝑵𝑳𝑬𝑺𝑺 𝑺𝑻𝑬𝑬𝑳 𝑴𝑬𝑻𝑨𝑳 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】: The 4 Pack W10400895 Washer Suspension Spring is made of high quality stainless steel spring materials for excellent durability and firmness. The high quality stainless steel material makes the springs less susceptible to rusting due to moisture in the washing machine, less likely to harden and become brittle, and able to remain flexible for a long time. A spring with elasticity is the best way to keep the washing machine drum in balance and thus reduce vibration in the washing machine. 【𝟔𝟎 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: The W10400895 Whirlpool Washer Tub Centering Springs support 60 DAYS return and exchange. ➤The main purpose of the springs is for traction and vibration damping, they are not fixed. The springs are attached to the drum on four sides so that the drum is in the centre of the washing machine and has a certain position of movement, which keeps the drum balanced by traction and reduces vibration at the same time. ➤If spring is broken, the washer will have the FOLLOWING CONDITIONS, and the spring need to be replaced in time: The washing machine is out of balance. Washing machine shakes and moves. Washing machine is noisy. 【𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑳𝑬 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳】---Beaquicy 4 Pack W10400895 Washer Suspension Tub Centering Spring fit for Amana,Crosley,Inglis,Ken-more,May-tag,Roper,Whirlpool Washing Machines. ➤Replaces part numbers：W10348658,W10400895VP,1938554,AP5263280,PS3497596,EAP3497596. ➤Replacement for washer models:11020022012, 11021102012, 11021102013, 11021182012, 11021252111, 11021252112, 11021292012, 11021302012, 11021302013, 11021352111, 11021352112, 11021392012, 7MMVWC210YW0, 7MMVWC300YW1, 7MMVWC310YW0, 7MMVWC400YW1 etc. 【𝑫𝑰𝒀 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵】---Disconnect the power before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands.The installation needs to use a pair of gloves and screwdriver.You can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install it,as there were plenty of do it yourself videos on there that helped guide you on the repair, saving you hundreds of dollars over calling in a repairman to fix something that a homeowner can do themselves! Great Product and Great Price!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719+EOdu17L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08593DZDV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-121909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08593DZDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08593DZDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
